      "type": "text",
      "text": "W.o advanced HIV: induction w IV liposomal amphotericin B + oral flucytosine for 2 to 4 wks (amphotericin B deoxycholate if ⍉lipid form); then PO fluconazole: consolidation 8 wks, maintenance 6 to 12 mo"
     }
    ]
   },
