    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Advanced HIV: induction w IV liposomal amphotericin B Q1x day + oral flucytosine for the first 2 wks; alt: single ↑dose IV liposomal amphotericin B (day 1) + oral flucytosine and PO fluconazole for 2 wks"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
